#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "671\t749"
msgid "Do it!"
msgstr "¡Date prisa y mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "764\t864"
msgid "We wanna see him bleed!"
msgstr "¡Ya queremos verlo muerto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "869\t954"
msgid "Yeah, end that fool!"
msgstr "¡Así es, acábalo de una vez!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "959\t1039"
msgid "I thought this was a deathmatch!"
msgstr "¡Pensé que esto era un combate a muerte!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1044\t1148"
msgid "The hell, man? Quit stalling!"
msgstr "¿Qué estás haciendo? ¡Ya mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1153\t1207"
msgid "Kill him!"
msgstr "¡Mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1207\t1259"
msgid "Kill him! Kill him!"
msgstr "¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1259\t1313"
msgid "Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!"
msgstr "¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1313\t1385"
msgid "Kill him! Kill him! Kill him! Kill him!"
msgstr "¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo! ¡Mátalo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1447\t1551"
msgid "You already buried 18 other poor saps!"
msgstr "¡Serás idiota, ya mataste a 18 personas!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1552\t1657"
msgid "What's the big deal adding one more!?"
msgstr "¡¿Cuál es el problema con matar a una más?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1662\t1781"
msgid "What're you waiting for?\\nFinish him off!"
msgstr "¡¿Qué mierdas estás esperando?!\\n¡Mátalo ya!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2841\t2927"
msgid "Attaboy! It's time for some action!"
msgstr "¡Muy bien! ¡Ahora termina con él!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3751\t3838"
msgid "Shut your fuckin' holes!"
msgstr "¡Cierren sus putas bocas!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "3958\t4109"
msgid "Which one of you lunatics said\\nkilling a guy's no big deal!?"
msgstr "¡¿Quién de ustedes dijo que no había\\nproblema con matar a uno más?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4134\t4194"
msgid "Was it you!?"
msgstr "¡¿Fuiste tú?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4276\t4336"
msgid "Or you!?"
msgstr "¡¿O tú?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4414\t4569"
msgid "Ya sit up there chantin' \"kill, kill, kill.\""
msgstr "Están ahí sentandos gritando \"mátalo, mátalo\"..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4587\t4757"
msgid "But how many of ya have\\ntaken a life with your own two hands!?"
msgstr "Pero, ¡¿cuántos de ustedes\\nrealmente a matado a alguien?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "4883\t5002"
msgid "Fuckin' hyenas.\\nLemme fill ya in on somethin'."
msgstr "¿Nadie?\\nLes contaré como se siente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5037\t5112"
msgid "Killin' another man..."
msgstr "Matar a otra persona..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5182\t5269"
msgid "Watchin' them breathe their last breath..."
msgstr "¡Matar a otra persona...!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5322\t5424"
msgid "It's a fuckin' nightmare!"
msgstr "¡Es jodidamente aterrador!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5520\t5700"
msgid "Been 25 years since that day...\\nbut I still remember it crystal clear."
msgstr "Desde hace 25 años, todos los días,\\n cuando duermo tengo esa pesadilla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5745\t5833"
msgid "Every night I dream of those 18 guys."
msgstr "Sueño con los 18 tipos que asesiné."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5849\t5937"
msgid "My fists bashin' their heads in."
msgstr "Mis puños golpeando sus rostros."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "5958\t6018"
msgid "The sound of bones crackin'."
msgstr "El sonido de sus huesos quebrándose."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6023\t6083"
msgid "The screams."
msgstr "Sus gritos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6103\t6177"
msgid "The fear on their dyin' faces."
msgstr "El miedo en sus rostros moribundos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6239\t6334"
msgid "I've been relivin' it every single day."
msgstr "Todo, con detalle, aparece en esa pesadilla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6377\t6525"
msgid "N' think about how their families felt.\\nIt must've been mortifyin'."
msgstr "Y por supuesto que siento pena\\npor las familias de los que asesiné."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6559\t6668"
msgid "But that... That remorse..."
msgstr "Pero... Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6673\t6742"
msgid "It's nothin' next to the real horror!"
msgstr "¡No se trata solo de eso!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6861\t6924"
msgid "Once ya snuff out a life..."
msgstr "Una vez que apagas una vida..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "6948\t7088"
msgid "There's no escapin' the dread of what ya did!"
msgstr "¡No hay escapatoria al horror de tus acciones!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7144\t7277"
msgid "Day in, day out, I gotta relive that bloodbath!"
msgstr "¡Y día tras día revivo ese horror!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7306\t7451"
msgid "Any of you got a fuckin' idea what that's like!?"
msgstr "¡¿Alguno de ustedes sabe lo doloroso que es eso?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7534\t7629"
msgid "This tournament's a crock o' shit."
msgstr "Este torneo es una estupidez..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "7694\t7750"
msgid "I'm out."
msgstr "Estoy fuera."

